1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Exercise 6-8, hold your tongue. You and I are going to read with our tongues firmly

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:10,800
held at the roofs of our mouths. If you want, hold a clean dime there with the

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,880
tongue's tip. The dime will let you know when you've dropped your tongue because it

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:18,020
will fall out. Do not use candy. It will hold itself there since wet candy is

5
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:22,040
sticky. If you prefer, you can read with your tongue between your teeth instead of

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,560
the standard behind the teeth position and use a small mirror. Remember that with

7
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:32,580
this technique, you can actually see your tongue disappear. L sounds drop off. It's

8
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,840
going to sound ridiculous, of course, and nobody would ever intentionally sound like

9
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:42,960
this, but no one will hear you practice. You don't want to sound like this. Force

10
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:49,000
your tongue to make all the various vowels in spite of its position. Let's go. Viva

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Lofroa!
